;//CH:【爽史】[r],seifuku

[r]星期三早上。澪音学姐是值日生，桃酱说要叫醒真珠星之后出门，所以……
[np]

[chisato storage="B_seifuku_M AB_1_M" trans=false]
[aoi storage="A_seifuku_M A_4_M" trans=false]
[char_trans]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_001.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_A_4_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「今天虽然那个魔女不在……但也不能放松警惕」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[chisato storage="A_seifuku_M AB_5_M"]
[playcv storage="chisato_all_00180_001.ogg" name="chisato"]
[character name="chisato"]
[FACEVIEW storage="chisato_AB_5_FACE_seifuku"]
【千圣】[r]「没必要没必要」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]今天是我们三人一起上学。
[np]

[aoi storage="B_seifuku_M B_7_M"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_002.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_B_7_FACE_seifuku"]
[char_jump name=aoi]
【葵】[r]「哈……那边的黑猫难道是混沌术士转世吗！？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[chisato storage="C_seifuku_M CD_1_M"]
[playcv storage="chisato_all_00180_002.ogg" name="chisato"]
[character name="chisato"]
[FACEVIEW storage="chisato_CD_1_FACE_seifuku"]
【千圣】[r]「戴着项圈，应该是谁家养的猫吧」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[aoi storage="D_seifuku_M CD_9_M"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_003.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_CD_9_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「电线上的乌鸦……是要向我传达冥界的消息——」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[chisato storage="D_seifuku_M CD_3_M"]
[playcv storage="chisato_all_00180_003.ogg" name="chisato"]
[character name="chisato"]
[FACEVIEW storage="chisato_CD_3_FACE_seifuku"]
【千圣】[r]「因为今天是可燃垃圾回收日，它们只是在等这个吧」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[aoi storage="C_seifuku_M CD_10_M"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_004.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_CD_10_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「…………」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]葵对绫濑条理分明的应对显得有些不甘心的样子。
[np]

[r]看着绫濑这样普通人的表现，我反而感到莫名安心。
[np]

[r]伏木庄的女生们……虽然桃酱还算比较正常，但基本上都患有中二病。
[np]

[r]可以说伏木庄的良心就是绫濑了。要是没有绫濑在，这会儿我早就——
[np]

[chisato storage="B_seifuku_M AB_3_M"]
[playcv storage="chisato_all_00180_004.ogg" name="chisato"]
[character name="chisato"]
[FACEVIEW storage="chisato_AB_3_FACE_seifuku"]
【千圣】[r]「啊、那只吉娃娃好可爱……」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[aoi storage="B_seifuku_M B_7_M"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_005.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_B_7_FACE_seifuku"]
[char_jump name=aoi]
【葵】[r]「！？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]正前方，一只吉娃娃和主人并排走来。确实挺可爱的。
[np]

;//[char_erase name="aoi chisato"]

[chisato storage="A_seifuku_M AB_1_M" trans=false]
[aoi storage="A_seifuku_S A_7_S" trans=false]
[char_trans]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_006.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_A_7_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「这、这……这家伙……！」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[chisato storage="C_seifuku_M CD_5_M"]
[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「搞什么、这次你又要说它是地狱看门狗之类的吗？」
[np]

[aoi storage="D_seifuku_S CD_9_S"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_007.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_CD_9_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「何、何等邪恶的气息……！这是紧急情况！」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「诶……？」
[np]

[aoi storage="C_seifuku_S CD_9_S"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_008.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_CD_9_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「为、为了保护你们俩、我、我、我必须想办法……！」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「喂、喂喂……」
[np]

[r]和之前遇到猫跟乌鸦时不同、这次她慌得不行……怎么回事？
[np]

[chisato storage="A_seifuku_M AB_5_M"]
[playcv storage="chisato_all_00180_005.ogg" name="chisato"]
[character name="chisato"]
[FACEVIEW storage="chisato_AB_5_FACE_seifuku"]
【千圣】[r]「好了好了到此为止。葵、冷静点」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[aoi storage="B_seifuku_S B_4_S"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_009.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_B_4_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「呜、呜呜……」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]直到吉娃娃走远，葵一直躲在绫濑背后。
[np]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「……难道说，你怕狗吗？」
[np]

[aoi storage="C_seifuku_M CD_10_M"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_010.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_CD_10_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「那、那是……」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[chisato storage="D_seifuku_M CD_5_M"]
[playcv storage="chisato_all_00180_006.ogg" name="chisato"]
[character name="chisato"]
[FACEVIEW storage="chisato_CD_5_FACE_seifuku"]
【千圣】[r]「看来就是这样呢。一看到狗，她基本都是这副模样……」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[aoi storage="A_seifuku_M A_8_M"]
[playcv storage="aoi_all_00180_011.ogg" name="aoi"]
[character name="aoi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="aoi_A_8_FACE_seifuku"]
【葵】[r]「才、才没有怕呢！要是打起来我可不会输！」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「哪能跟狗打架啊」
[np]

[char_erase name="aoi chisato"]

[r]怕狗啊……女孩子的话，倒也不算稀奇吧。
[np]

